			"notes": "# Crystals - 1.4.0\n- **Add enriched ore variants (diamond, emerald, redstone, lapis, quartz)**\n*With a pointed dripstone with water on the top of an enriched ore you can grow ore crystals.*\n- **Add diamond, emerald, redstone, lapis, quartz and glowstone geodes.**\n*You can find the enriched ore in the geodes.*\n- Add grow variants of the ore crystals *(small, medium and big)*.\n- Create uk_ua.json by @StarmanMine142 in [#3](https://github.com/Killarexe/Crystals/pull/3)\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Killarexe/Crystals/compare/1.3.1...1.4.0"
		},
